Blast reported in Saudi Arabia's Riyadh






                A loud explosion was heard early on Thursday morning in Saudi Arabia's capital of Riyadh, according to AFP.&nbsp;

The blast follows&nbsp;an alert from the Saudi civil defence regarding a "potential danger", which was later lifted.&nbsp;

